==English==

===Alternative forms===
* {{l|en|stalworth}}

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|sco}} {{term|stalwart|lang=sco}} from {{etyl|enm}} {{term|stalward|lang=enm}}, variation of {{term|stalwurthe|lang=enm}} from {{etyl|ang}} {{term|stælwierþe|stǣlwierþe|lang=ang}} "serviceable", equivalent to {{suffix|stæl|alt1=stǣl|wierþe|lang=ang}}. More at {{l|en|staddle}}, {{l|en|worth}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{a|UK}} {{IPA|/ˈstɔːlwət/}}, {{SAMPA|/"stO:lw@t/}}
* {{a|US}} {{enPR|stälʹwərt}}, {{IPA|/ˈstɑlwɚt/}}, {{SAMPA|/"stAlw@`t/}}

